PostgreSQL — COPY TEXT field escaping and array literals
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/sync/copy.ts`, the COPY TEXT serializer, ports two PostgreSQL backend routines
to TypeScript, with PostgreSQL 18 as the reference:

  - `CopyAttributeOutText` (src/backend/commands/copyto.c): COPY TEXT field escaping
  - `array_out` (src/backend/utils/adt/arrayfuncs.c): array literals

  Source:  https://www.postgresql.org
  License: PostgreSQL License
  Copyright (c) The PostgreSQL Global Development Group and The Regents of the
  University of California

The file carries a header saying so, and its compiled form ships in `dist/`.
